    "sections": {
        "description": "Aurelle is a calm, modern WooCommerce theme for skincare, beauty and lifestyle shops. It has a floating pill header with dropdown menus, a slide-in cart drawer, a filterable shop with a mobile filter drawer, a product page with a swipeable gallery and accordion tabs, and styled cart, checkout and account pages (blocks and classic). It has a journal layout for every post format, bundled fonts, block patterns and a Customizer panel for colours, the announcement bar, header icons and the free-shipping bar. It works without WooCommerce for a blog or brand site and supports Elementor full-width pages."
    },
